/* ============================================================
   THE BOLD. MARK, FOR OPEN GRAPH CARDS

   The real artwork from public/logo-lockup.png — cropped to the
   wordmark and keyed off its black ground, since the source is a
   3D render with no alpha and would otherwise drop a black box
   onto the card.

   Inlined rather than fetched. Satori renders these cards in an
   edge function, and a failed image fetch there does not throw —
   it returns a 200 with an empty body, so the card silently
   arrives blank in someone's messages with no error anywhere.
   A data URI removes that failure mode entirely.

   The Logo component cannot be used here: it is inline SVG built
   from gradients, filters and CSS custom properties, none of
   which satori resolves.

   Regenerate with:
     ffmpeg -i public/logo-lockup.png \
       -vf "crop=1120:225:225:348,colorkey=0x050505:0.12:0.05,scale=480:-1" \
       -pix_fmt rgba mark.png
   ============================================================ */

export const BOLD_MARK =
  'data:image/png;base64,';
